#: kicongrid.cpp:985
msgid ""
"The clipboard image is larger than the current image!\n"
"Paste as new image?"
msgstr ""
"L' imådje ki vos avoz copyî è tchapea emacralé est pus grande ki l' imådje ki vos ovrez dsu!\n"
"El fåt-i aclaper dins ene novele imådje?"

#: kicongrid.cpp:998
msgid "Pasting"
msgstr "Dj' aclape"

#: kicongrid.cpp:1030 kicongrid.cpp:1057
